  "solution": "Ta có \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tKhi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDựa vào <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tDo đó, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semant